<template><section class="workspace-page learning-hub"><PageHeader title="学一点，再验证一点。" description="从今天的任务出发，把知识连成可以走下去的路。" eyebrow="我的学习工作台"><template #actions><RouterLink to="/agent" class="icon-button" aria-label="让星枢安排学习任务"><Sparkles :size="20"/></RouterLink></template></PageHeader><nav class="workspace-segments learning-subnav" aria-label="学习子导航"><RouterLink v-for="tab in tabs" :key="tab.id" :to="{path:'/learn',query:{tab:tab.id}}" :aria-current="activeTab===tab.id?'page':undefined">{{ tab.label }}</RouterLink></nav><div v-if="store.error||error" class="m-error" role="alert">{{ error||store.error }}<button class="m-btn m-btn--ghost m-btn--sm" @click="store.refresh">重试</button></div><div v-if="store.loading&&!store.loaded" class="m-skeleton m-skeleton--block"/><template v-else>
<template v-if="activeTab==='tasks'"><div class="learning-overview"><span><b>{{ tasks.filter(t=>!t.done&&t.localState!=='deferred').length }}</b> 待开始或进行中</span><span><b>{{ tasks.filter(t=>t.done).length }}</b> 用户确认完成</span><RouterLink to="/review">错题与复习 →</RouterLink></div><div v-if="tasks.length" class="learning-today-rail"><div><span>今天先做这一步</span><b>{{ nextTask ? (nextTask.done ? '回看今天的完成记录' : nextTask.title) : '回看今天的完成记录' }}</b><small>{{ nextTask && !nextTask.done ? '完成后会留下真实任务记录，再决定下一步。' : '真实完成记录会出现在复习与成长页。' }}</small></div><RouterLink v-if="nextTask && !nextTask.done" :to="{path:'/focus',query:{task:nextTask.id,...(nextTask.goalId?{goal:nextTask.goalId}:{})}}" class="m-btn m-btn--primary m-btn--sm">开始</RouterLink><RouterLink v-else to="/review" class="m-btn m-btn--ghost m-btn--sm">查看反馈</RouterLink></div><div v-if="!tasks.length" class="workspace-empty learning-empty"><div class="learning-empty__eyebrow">今天的第一步</div><Waypoints :size="32"/><h2>先有一个目标，再安排今天。</h2><p>创建目标后，你可以确认一份任务清单；完成真实学习后，结果会进入复习和成长记录。</p><div class="learning-empty__steps"><div><b>1</b><span>创建一个当前目标<small>告诉我想学什么、每天能投入多久</small></span></div><div><b>2</b><span>确认今天的第一步<small>星枢只生成预览，确认后才执行</small></span></div><div><b>3</b><span>留下真实反馈<small>完成练习或专注后再安排下一步</small></span></div></div><div class="workspace-actions"><RouterLink to="/workspace" class="m-btn m-btn--primary m-btn--sm">创建目标</RouterLink><RouterLink to="/agent" class="m-btn m-btn--ghost m-btn--sm">让星枢拆解任务</RouterLink></div></div><div class="learning-task-grid"><LearningTaskCard v-for="task in tasks" :key="task.id" :task="task" :goal-name="store.workspace?.goals.find(g=>g.id===task.goalId)?.title" :busy="busy===task.id" @start="start(task)" @complete="complete(task)" @defer="store.setTaskState(task.id,task.localState==='deferred'?'pending':'deferred')"/></div></template>
<template v-else-if="activeTab==='focus'"><div class="learning-focus-entry"><DashboardWidget title="给自己一段不被打扰的时间" eyebrow="专注学习"><p class="learning-primary-copy">25 分钟是一个建议，不是负担。支持 10、15、25、45 分钟，暂停与退出后都可以恢复。</p><div class="learning-focus-actions"><RouterLink to="/focus" class="m-btn m-btn--primary">{{ ongoing?'继续上次专注':'开始专注学习 25 分钟' }}<ArrowUpRight :size="18"/></RouterLink><RouterLink :to="{path:'/focus',query:{mode:'materials'}}" class="m-btn m-btn--ghost">知识库伴学</RouterLink></div><p class="workspace-caption">真实计时由服务器保存；达到有效时长后，本机奖励账本只领取一次。</p></DashboardWidget><AIPetAvatar :kind="store.local.pet" :stage="store.pet.stage"/></div><div class="workspace-section-head"><h2>最近完成的专注</h2><RouterLink to="/growth">查看记录与报告 →</RouterLink></div><div class="m-card"><p v-if="!store.timeRecords.length" class="workspace-caption">还没有已结束计时。开始第一段专注后再来看看。</p><div v-for="record in store.timeRecords.slice(0,6)" :key="record.id" class="learning-focus-record"><span>{{ dateLabel(record.at) }}</span><b>{{ Math.floor(record.seconds/60) }} 分 {{ record.seconds%60 }} 秒</b><small>{{ store.workspace?.goals.find(g=>g.id===record.goalId)?.title || '独立专注' }}</small></div></div></template>
<template v-else-if="activeTab==='practice'"><DashboardWidget title="从一组真实练习，检验理解" eyebrow="服务器题库"><p class="learning-primary-copy">选择当前路径知识点。标准答案与分数由服务器记录，完成后可以查看解释与错题。</p><label class="m-field"><span>知识点</span><select v-model="topicId" class="m-input"><option value="">请选择已生成路径中的知识点</option><option v-for="topic in topics" :key="topic.id" :value="topic.id">{{ topic.name }}</option></select></label><div class="workspace-actions"><button class="m-btn m-btn--primary" :disabled="!topicId||!!busy" @click="practice">开始练习</button><RouterLink to="/review" class="m-btn m-btn--ghost">错题复习</RouterLink><RouterLink to="/self-test" class="m-btn m-btn--ghost">其他题型自测</RouterLink></div><p class="workspace-caption">当前服务器权威判分支持单选题。其他题型提供明确标识的本机自测，不写入服务器成绩。</p><RouterLink v-if="!topics.length" to="/diagnose" class="workspace-text-action">先确认学习起点并生成路径 →</RouterLink></DashboardWidget><div class="workspace-section-head"><h2>可以恢复的练习</h2><span>服务器保存的作答</span></div><div class="m-card"><p v-if="!store.workspace?.sessions.length" class="workspace-caption">还没有练习会话，不会填入示例记录。</p><RouterLink v-for="session in store.workspace?.sessions||[]" :key="session.id" :to="`/study/session/${session.id}${session.status==='completed'?'/result':''}`" class="learning-session-link"><span><b>{{ session.status==='completed'?'查看练习结果':'继续未完成练习' }}</b><small>{{ session.answered }} / {{ session.exerciseIds.length }} 题 · {{ dateLabel(session.createdAt) }}</small></span><ChevronRight :size="17"/></RouterLink></div></template>
<template v-else><div class="learning-plan-goals"><label class="m-field"><span>长期目标</span><select v-model="selectedGoal" class="m-input"><option value="">全部目标</option><option v-for="goal in store.workspace?.goals||[]" :key="goal.id" :value="goal.id">{{ goal.title }}</option></select></label><RouterLink to="/workspace" class="m-btn m-btn--ghost m-btn--sm">创建或调整目标</RouterLink></div><article v-for="goal in store.workspace?.goals.filter(g=>!selectedGoal||g.id===selectedGoal)||[]" :key="goal.id" class="m-card learning-goal-plan"><div class="task-card-head"><span class="m-badge m-badge--info">{{ statuses[goal.status] }}</span><span>{{ dateLabel(goal.deadline) }}</span></div><h2>{{ goal.title }}</h2><p>{{ goal.dailyMinutes }} 分钟 / 天 · 状态来自用户设置</p><div class="workspace-actions"><RouterLink to="/workspace" class="workspace-text-action">编辑 / 暂停 / 恢复目标 →</RouterLink><RouterLink :to="{path:'/agent',query:{goal:goal.id}}" class="workspace-text-action">让星枢提出调整方案 →</RouterLink></div></article><DashboardWidget title="阶段与知识点" eyebrow="长期路径"><MobileLearningPath v-if="store.path&&!selectedGoal" :path="store.path"/><p v-else-if="selectedGoal" class="workspace-caption">现有路径接口尚未提供目标归属，筛选目标时不混入其他路径。可在下方查看该目标已确认的任务版本。</p><div v-else class="workspace-empty"><h3>先确认一个学习起点</h3><p>路径会在确认画像后生成，不用示例路线替代。</p><RouterLink to="/planning" class="m-btn m-btn--primary m-btn--sm">制定学习计划</RouterLink></div></DashboardWidget><div class="workspace-section-head"><h2>已确认的计划与调整</h2><span>每次执行保留独立任务记录</span></div><article v-for="task in planTasks" :key="task.id" class="m-card learning-plan-history"><h3>{{ task.prompt }}</h3><p>{{ dateLabel(task.updatedAt) }} · {{ task.source==='model'?'模型草稿':'规则整理' }}</p><ol><li v-for="item in task.checklist||[]" :key="item.id">{{ item.title }}<small>{{ item.minutes }} 分钟建议 · {{ item.done?'用户确认完成':'未确认完成' }}</small></li></ol><RouterLink to="/agent" class="workspace-text-action">查看产物与后续调整 →</RouterLink></article><p v-if="!planTasks.length" class="workspace-caption">没有该目标的已确认计划版本。星枢提出方案后，需你确认才会执行。</p></template>
</template></section></template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed,onMounted,ref } from 'vue'
import { useRoute,useRouter } from 'vue-router'
import { ArrowUpRight,ChevronRight,Sparkles,Waypoints } from 'lucide-vue-next'
import { useLearningWorkspace } from '@/mobile/stores/learning-workspace'
import { changeWorkspace,dateLabel } from '@/mobile/data/workspace'
import { createStudySession } from '@/mobile/data/study'
import PageHeader from '@/mobile/components/PageHeader.vue'
import DashboardWidget from '@/mobile/components/DashboardWidget.vue'
import LearningTaskCard from '@/mobile/components/LearningTaskCard.vue'
import MobileLearningPath from '@/mobile/components/MobileLearningPath.vue'
import AIPetAvatar from '@/mobile/components/AIPetAvatar.vue'
const store=useLearningWorkspace(),route=useRoute(),router=useRouter(),busy=ref(''),error=ref(''),topicId=ref(''),selectedGoal=ref(''),tabs=[{id:'tasks',label:'今日任务'},{id:'focus',label:'专注学习'},{id:'practice',label:'练习测试'},{id:'plan',label:'学习计划'}],statuses:Record<string,string>={active:'进行中',paused:'已暂停',completed:'用户确认完成',archived:'已归档'}
const activeTab=computed(()=>tabs.some(t=>t.id===route.query.tab)?String(route.query.tab):'tasks'),tasks=computed(()=>store.taskItems),nextTask=computed(()=>tasks.value.find(t=>!t.done&&t.localState!=='deferred')||tasks.value.find(t=>!t.done)||tasks.value[0]||null),topics=computed(()=>store.path?.phases.flatMap(p=>p.topics)||[]),ongoing=computed(()=>store.workspace?.focus.some(f=>f.status==='running'||f.status==='paused')),planTasks=computed(()=>store.workspace?.tasks.filter(t=>t.status==='completed'&&(!selectedGoal.value||t.goalId===selectedGoal.value))||[])
onMounted(()=>store.refresh())
function start(task:typeof store.taskItems[number]){store.setTaskState(task.id,'active');router.push({path:'/focus',query:{task:task.id,...(task.goalId?{goal:task.goalId}:{})}})}
async function complete(task:typeof store.taskItems[number]){busy.value=task.id;try{await changeWorkspace('checklist',{taskId:task.taskId,id:task.id,done:!task.done});await store.refresh()}catch(e){error.value=e instanceof Error?e.message:'保存失败'}finally{busy.value=''}}
async function practice(){busy.value='practice';try{const result=await createStudySession([topicId.value],3);if('error'in result)throw new Error(result.message);await router.push(`/study/session/${result.session.id}`)}catch(e){error.value=e instanceof Error?e.message:'创建失败'}finally{busy.value=''}}
</script>
<style scoped>.learning-overview{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:22px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--m-text-faint)}.learning-overview b{color:var(--m-text);font-size:19px;margin-right:6px}.learning-overview a,.learning-hub .workspace-section-head>a{color:var(--m-primary);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center}.learning-today-rail{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin:0 0 18px;padding:16px 18px;border:1px solid var(--m-primary-border);border-radius:18px;background:var(--m-focus-surface,var(--m-primary-soft))}.learning-today-rail>div{min-width:0}.learning-today-rail span,.learning-today-rail small{display:block;color:var(--m-text-faint);font-size:12px;line-height:1.7}.learning-today-rail b{display:block;margin:3px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.learning-today-rail .m-btn{flex:none}.learning-task-grid{display:grid;gap:16px}.learning-empty{padding:24px 20px 20px;text-align:left}.learning-empty>.m-icon{display:block;margin:10px 0;color:var(--m-primary)}.learning-empty__eyebrow{font-size:12px;color:var(--m-primary);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.4px}.learning-empty h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.45}.learning-empty>p{max-width:42em;margin:0;color:var(--m-text-dim);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}.learning-empty__steps{display:grid;gap:10px;margin:20px 0}.learning-empty__steps>div{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px}.learning-empty__steps b{display:grid;place-items:center;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--m-primary-soft);color:var(--m-primary);font-size:12px;flex:none}.learning-empty__steps span{font-size:14px;color:var(--m-text);line-height:1.5}.learning-empty__steps small{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:var(--m-text-faint);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.learning-empty .workspace-actions{margin-top:4px}.learning-primary-copy{font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--m-text-dim);margin:0 0 22px}.learning-focus-entry{position:relative}.learning-focus-entry>.ai-pet-avatar{width:140px;position:absolute;right:18px;top:10px;opacity:.85;pointer-events:none}.learning-focus-entry .dashboard-widget{padding-right:85px}.learning-focus-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0}.learning-focus-record{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:8px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--m-border);font-size:14px}.learning-focus-record small{grid-column:1/-1;color:var(--m-text-faint);font-size:12px}.learning-session-link{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--m-border);color:var(--m-text);text-decoration:none}.learning-session-link b{font-size:15px;font-weight:500}.learning-session-link small{display:block;color:var(--m-text-faint);font-size:12px;margin-top:7px}.learning-plan-goals{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.learning-plan-goals .m-field{flex:1;min-width:180px}.learning-goal-plan{margin-bottom:18px}.learning-goal-plan h2{font-size:22px}.learning-goal-plan p{font-size:14px;color:var(--m-text-faint)}.task-card-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--m-text-faint)}.learning-plan-history{margin-bottom:14px}.learning-plan-history h3{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7}.learning-plan-history p,.learning-plan-history li{font-size:14px;color:var(--m-text-dim);line-height:1.9}.learning-plan-history small{display:block;color:var(--m-text-faint);font-size:12px}.learning-plan-history ol{padding-left:22px}@media(min-width:1100px){.learning-task-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:479px){.learning-focus-entry>.ai-pet-avatar{width:100px;right:8px;top:20px}.learning-focus-entry .dashboard-widget{padding-right:0}.learning-focus-entry .learning-primary-copy{padding-right:70px}.learning-today-rail{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.learning-today-rail .m-btn{width:100%}.learning-empty h2{font-size:20px}}</style>
